  "description": "Kafka producer runtime for .NET, built on Akka.NET Streams. One DI line (AddSharedKafkaProducer) and one call (IEventProducer.PublishAsync) to publish events to Kafka. Every message is wrapped in an EventEnvelope with auto-generated event-id, event-type, occurred-at, and optional tenant-id headers. Idempotent producer is enabled by default. Config-driven SSL/SASL — works against Aiven, AWS MSK, Confluent Cloud, or self-hosted Kafka with no code changes.",
